****Only use this Trinket set if there is a distractor that meets such criteria in the first place.
***'''{{TI|Train Whistle|name=true}}''', to make escaping with the {{Debuff|Slow|}}Debuff easier without losing much Stamina;
***'''{{TI|Star Pillow|name=true}}''', to regenerate [[Stamina]] faster while extracting, taking advantage of her high Stamina and slow extraction;
